139
00:06:41.968 --> 00:06:44.270
It gives you defense against edge cases.

140
00:06:44.570 --> 00:06:48.374
So protection against prompt injection or other nefarious acts.

141
00:06:48.775 --> 00:06:51.144
It gives you regulatory compliance,

142
00:06:51.444 --> 00:06:54.447
credential isolation, and full governance protection.

